1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,040
In this lesson, you'll build a complete
funnel without starting from a blank page.

2
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:08,971
We'll pick a template, make it look
like your business, and publish it.

3
00:00:08,971 --> 00:00:09,469
Let's go.

4
00:00:10,337 --> 00:00:13,525
Go to Sites, then Funnels,
and click New Funnel.

5
00:00:13,525 --> 00:00:18,707
You can start from blank, use a template,
or let Funnels AI draft one for you.

6
00:00:18,707 --> 00:00:23,223
Funnels AI is billed per funnel,
so today we'll use a free template.

7
00:00:24,075 --> 00:00:26,637
Click From Template to open the library.

8
00:00:26,637 --> 00:00:30,033
Use the categories on the
left to narrow things down.

9
00:00:30,033 --> 00:00:34,389
There are designs for dental and
health practices, local businesses,

10
00:00:34,389 --> 00:00:35,670
and lead generation.

11
00:00:36,520 --> 00:00:38,826
Before you choose, preview the template.

12
00:00:38,826 --> 00:00:43,380
Check it on mobile too, because that's
where most of your visitors will see it.

13
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:47,589
This one has a clear headline, a short
form, and a strong call to action.

14
00:00:48,441 --> 00:00:49,304
Happy with it?

15
00:00:49,304 --> 00:00:53,128
Click Use, and give your funnel
a name you'll recognise later.

16
00:00:53,128 --> 00:00:58,186
Bloom is launching dental implants, so
we'll call it Dental Implants Consultation.

17
00:00:59,051 --> 00:01:03,932
And just like that, you have a three-step
funnel: an opt-in page, a booking page,

18
00:01:03,932 --> 00:01:05,198
and a thank-you page.

19
00:01:05,198 --> 00:01:08,271
Each step is still a draft,
so nothing is live yet.

20
00:01:08,271 --> 00:01:10,742
Let's open the first step and click Edit.

21
00:01:11,591 --> 00:01:13,249
Welcome to the page builder.

22
00:01:13,249 --> 00:01:14,493
First, make it yours.

23
00:01:14,493 --> 00:01:17,633
Click the business name at
the top and type your own.

24
00:01:17,633 --> 00:01:21,423
In the settings panel on the
right, update the phone number too.

25
00:01:22,249 --> 00:01:25,619
Now the headline, the most
important words on the page.

26
00:01:25,619 --> 00:01:27,457
Say exactly what visitors get.

27
00:01:27,457 --> 00:01:30,213
Click it, select the
text, and type your own.

28
00:01:31,038 --> 00:01:32,099
Select the button.

29
00:01:32,099 --> 00:01:36,756
Here you can change its text, its colour,
and what happens when someone clicks.

30
00:01:36,756 --> 00:01:39,467
In this template, it
scrolls down to the form.

31
00:01:39,467 --> 00:01:41,825
Let's switch the colour to Bloom's teal.

32
00:01:42,675 --> 00:01:45,341
Swap the template image for one of yours.

33
00:01:45,341 --> 00:01:48,983
Select the image, click Replace
image, and pick a photo.

34
00:01:48,983 --> 00:01:53,925
Then add alt text, a short description
that helps Google and screen readers.

35
00:01:54,775 --> 00:01:55,971
Click Save as you go.

36
00:01:55,971 --> 00:01:59,216
When you're ready for the
world to see it, click Publish.

37
00:01:59,216 --> 00:02:02,177
The status at the top tells
you everything is saved.

38
00:02:03,027 --> 00:02:06,369
Back in the funnel, give the
step a clean web address.

39
00:02:06,369 --> 00:02:09,216
Open the step menu,
choose Edit name and path,

40
00:02:09,216 --> 00:02:13,423
and type something short and
descriptive, like implant consultation.

41
00:02:14,271 --> 00:02:17,792
Repeat the same edits on the
booking and thank-you steps,

42
00:02:17,792 --> 00:02:20,016
so the whole journey looks like you.

43
00:02:20,016 --> 00:02:23,166
In lesson 7.5, we'll connect
your own domain to it.

44
00:02:24,018 --> 00:02:25,114
Here's a pro tip.

45
00:02:25,114 --> 00:02:29,691
Templates are laid out to convert,
so resist the urge to redesign them.

46
00:02:29,691 --> 00:02:34,269
Keep the structure, and spend your
time on the words: a clear headline,

47
00:02:34,269 --> 00:02:36,912
real benefits, and one obvious next step.

48
00:02:37,762 --> 00:02:39,423
Your first funnel is live!

49
00:02:39,423 --> 00:02:44,469
Next, we'll go deeper into the page
builder: sections, rows, columns, elements,

50
00:02:44,469 --> 00:02:45,491
and mobile view.

51
00:02:45,491 --> 00:02:46,386
See you there.
